      "text": "- Run local.\n- Use code assistant cli interface: Claude-code, Opencode\n- When starting for the first time ask for the Memory assets\n- Create a follow-up application database.\n- Agent should learn (coumpound) from the application processes\n- file based repo (.md), with structured folder tree\n- Process status folder based",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Run local.\n- Use code assistant cli interface: Claude-code, Opencode\n- When starting for the first time ask for the Memory assets\n- Create a follow-up application database.\n- Agent should learn (coumpound) from the application processes\n- file based repo (.md), with structured folder tree\n- Process status folder based",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
